{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：14:41 2026-05-24 HKT</p>\n\n<p>今日第三場四班千二米爆冷收場，於今年三月在田草千二米贏馬的「錶之浩瀚」，連輸三場之後，今日改配韋紀力跑同程，入閘前獨贏賠率由二十六倍跌至十倍，結果飛到馬到，該駒後上勝出，贏得今季第二場頭馬。</p>\n<p>賽後「錶之浩瀚」馬主楊潔怡說：「我對『錶之浩瀚』賽前有一定信心，此馬今場克服外檔和負重磅的阻力，順利取勝，希望牠繼續進步。『錶之浩瀚』上場出賽時，場地鬆軟，馬兒可能不太喜歡，今日陽光普照，場地乾快，馬兒跑出應有的水準，希望我們一家人『錶』系馬繼續有好成績。」</p>\n<p>「錶之浩瀚』練馬師巫偉傑說：「一出報名表，我已經搵韋紀力騎『錶之浩瀚』，我和他認識多年，加上他在澳洲是前列騎師，又曾經在香港策騎，對香港賽馬模式十分熟悉。『錶之浩瀚』上場黃寶妮跑來轉彎時有少少心急，擺前少少，加上步速不太有利，今場韋紀力留住跑，讓馬兒跑出應有的水準。」</p>\n<h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a7c9eada371eb3da5bfe31a0da5d431d/2026-05/3ffa1664-c169-4904-9c6c-0ca93b1e4e98.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1794815a324354fd34fb56987a365576/2026-05/4de5ec62-59d3-426f-9ebd-0209ef0f19fc.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4b57e6f0aa57c5019609607bb2fdf567/2026-05/4e5bed95-3ebd-4dd2-85e6-78760b5753d9.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/036fefa3c32b92ed23f70bd3fe98b868/2026-05/8c98646a-f2f7-4c3d-aaa2-d993e15ea24c.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c95c2dfcea8a504098a58924d545d8c6/2026-05/35a4082e-670d-4bd2-a6f1-54f3aefd0d6f.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/207bf9e9b1f96416d2539d797c2cf6e6/2026-05/37d35690-17be-4f7e-b66a-a7a8e7594902.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ea105bd7260cb61e15d8ede346925cb3/2026-05/81ebf114-4f1f-4cd8-ae5c-df8dc5c0ce0e.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9083c78284074744768922b7680e01bb/2026-05/b93d9898-bdab-4106-afe3-0d88e1759784.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/289e12ac06b66b4c200ac8a7feebbb10/2026-05/c5f6c8c8-d9f2-445c-b539-df7a99c5b1bc.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6eb7deedee8224cedc6c73987d3974dc/2026-05/c92a42b1-b04d-4627-93b8-b9669c0ffaa5.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ce8b0c629d831d4638e6f25e33bfc23c/2026-05/c48020bb-4d7f-4104-a696-b85530060ffd.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d321d83bd19544c50a9c80f86ebaffed/2026-05/dc21ea37-b601-4fc2-aa27-cd7dae3d10d1.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/548a617575382046abfe0c23d8be1606/2026-05/f15d54b5-c035-422c-b607-8310c7fe5524.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-24T06:58:38.174233+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":396,"images":13,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}